      "text": "• 4 Chambers: Atria receive blood; ventricles pump blood.\n• Valves prevent backflow; Septum prevents mixing.\n• Double Circulation: Pulmonary (heart-lungs) + Systemic (heart-body).\n• Complete separation gives high energy efficiency for warm-blooded life.",
